  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HKphpcF.png\" alt=\"毛絨玩偶模組\" width=\"856\" height=\"112\"></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>此模組為您的遊戲增添了許多可愛的 Minecraft 毛絨玩偶！</em></h1>\n<p><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bQC6j31.png\" alt=\"毛絨玩偶\" width=\"841\" height=\"442\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><br></em></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\">重要事項：</span></strong></em><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><br></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">v1.3 以上版本需要 Architectury API！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">若使用 Fabric，您還需安裝 Fabric API！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">請協助我們在此處翻譯此模組：<a href=\"https://gist.github.com/Link4real/c465b77b9dd02802ca35197f6db3500b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組未來將持續獲得更新。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>請注意：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>非官方 Minecraft 產品。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em>未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 授權或認可。</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img style=\"text-align:center\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LMC7eqB.png\" alt=\"毛絨玩偶模組 3D\" width=\"364\" height=\"205\"><br></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://gist.github.com/Link4real/af545420163c11858c4f4640b00191cd\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3L7vkvu.png\" alt=\"GitHub Gist 連結\" width=\"390\" height=\"122\"></a></span></h1>",
